Champ Type Description <code>username</code> <code>string</code> Nom d'utilisateur <code>email</code> <code>string</code> Adresse mail <code>password</code> <code>string</code> Mot de passe (en clair) <code>lang</code> <code>string</code> Langue utilisée (<code>FR</code>, <code>EN</code>, <code>NL</code>) <p><pre><code>POST /user/register HTTP/1.1
Host: example.com
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: */*
Cookie: auth=encoded_jwt

{
    "username": "example",
    "email": "example@gmail.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "lang": "FR"
}
</code></pre> ou <pre><code>fetch("/user/register", {
    method: "POST",
    body: JSON.stringify({
        username: form.username.value,
        email: form.email.value,
        password: form.password.value,
        lang: form.lang.value
    }),
    credentials: "include"
});
</code></pre></p>

Champ Type Description <code>email</code> <code>string</code> Adresse mail <code>password</code> <code>string</code> Mot de passe (en clair) <p><pre><code>POST /user/login HTTP/1.1
Host: example.com
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: */*
Cookie: auth=encoded_jwt

{
    "email": "example@gmail.com",
    "password": "password123",
}
</code></pre> <pre><code>POST /user/log2fa HTTP/1.1
Host: example.com
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: */*
Cookie: auth=encoded_jwt

{
    "code": "123456"
}
</code></pre> ou <pre><code>fetch("/user/login", {
    method: "POST",
    body: JSON.stringify({
        email: form.email.value,
        password: form.password.value,
    }),
    credentials: "include"
}).then(response =&gt; response.json()).then(data =&gt; {
    if (!data.error &amp;&amp; data.twoFA)
        fetch("/user/log2fa", {
            method: "POST",
            body: JSON.stringify({ code: input.value }),
            credentials: "include"
        })
});
</code></pre></p>

